  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EnDev Energy Enterprise Coach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EnDev Energy Enterprise Coach (EEC) provides business development services (BDS) to renewable energy enterprises (encompassing at least 25% women owned), with the aim to support their professionalisation and thereby aspiring to scale operations and become investment ready in Africa and Asia. This is achieved by being a one-stop-shop facility for demand-driven interventions tailored to an enterprise&apos;s stage of growth, technology offering, context and location.</narrative>
  </description>
